widget.solution:
def merge_books(a, b):
    merged = dict(a)
    for ticker, qty in b.items():
        merged[ticker] = merged.get(ticker, 0) + qty
        if merged[ticker] == 0:
            del merged[ticker]
    return merged

explain.text:
`dict(a)` gives a copy to work on, so neither desk's book changes. Netting each of `b`'s positions into it is the same `get`-then-add step as before.

```python
